            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fresh feathers! Parrot 0.27.3</h3><ul><li>The Assistant's first tip now arrives once the call gets down to business.</li><li>No report on a meeting? Write report on its Report tab makes one, Assistant on or off.</li><li>On speakers, fewer echoes land under your name, even when you do most of the talking.</li><li>Clicking a line in a long transcript jumps there right away.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.27.3">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
